-- test: in a package of edition 0.4 that imports no name of the server, no value can hold a reply right, so a `start` that captures a function value under a `secret` program counter is no U4003 of IF6; the call of the function value that its task runs stands under that program counter, a check point that the schedule of started tasks counts, so it is U4002 (spec/31 §1, ADR 0123 IF6, spec/27 §8 rule 5, #1684)
-- spec: spec/31 §1
-- expect: error U4002 at src/m.una:11:15
module m

spawn(jobs: internal List[fn() -> Unit], key: secret Int) -> Unit
=
  tasks
    for job in jobs
      if key > 0
        start job()
      else
        unit
